N:Words from Alawon Cymru: verse 1 as the score gives it, the rest from its page. The Mari party sings the numbered verses; the house answers (Ateb). The recording plays B,2 B,4 A,2 and D2 B,4 C2 in the seventh and tenth bars, where the score has D2 B,4 A,2.
